    "detailed_description": "<strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Innovative Match-3 Mechanics: Match tiles to generate ammunition for your squad. Each color powers a different squad member.<br></li><li> Diverse Squad Members: Command a unique squad with members such as the Soldier, Sniper, SWAT, and Demolition man. Each has their own color and abilities.<br></li><li> Skill Trees: After each wave, allocate skill points to upgrade your squad members' abilities and improve your chances of survival.<br></li><li> Waves of Zombies: Face increasingly challenging waves of zombies.<br></li><li> Many planned future updates: Expect new squad members, skills, and more content in future updates.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>In Match Kill Survive, every match you make counts. Each match-3 combination generates ammunition for a specific squad member based on the color of the tiles. Use these points wisely to fend off the zombie hordes. After surviving a wave, reward your squad members with skill points and customize their skill trees to enhance their abilities.<br><br><br><strong>Coming up:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Steam achievements (DONE)<br></li><li> Steam high scores w/ friends (DONE)<br></li><li> Translations (DONE)<br></li><li> flexible squad composition (DONE)<br></li><li> difficulty levels (DONE)<br></li><li> more classes (WIP)<br></li><li> special blocks<br></li><li> special zombies<br></li><li> target prioritisation for your squad members<br></li><li> different game mode(s)<br></li><li> ... and more!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Innovative Match-3 Mechanics: Match tiles to generate ammunition for your squad. Each color powers a different squad member.<br></li><li> Diverse Squad Members: Command a unique squad with members such as the Soldier, Sniper, SWAT, and Demolition man. Each has their own color and abilities.<br></li><li> Skill Trees: After each wave, allocate skill points to upgrade your squad members' abilities and improve your chances of survival.<br></li><li> Waves of Zombies: Face increasingly challenging waves of zombies.<br></li><li> Many planned future updates: Expect new squad members, skills, and more content in future updates.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>In Match Kill Survive, every match you make counts. Each match-3 combination generates ammunition for a specific squad member based on the color of the tiles. Use these points wisely to fend off the zombie hordes. After surviving a wave, reward your squad members with skill points and customize their skill trees to enhance their abilities.<br><br><br><strong>Coming up:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Steam achievements (DONE)<br></li><li> Steam high scores w/ friends (DONE)<br></li><li> Translations (DONE)<br></li><li> flexible squad composition (DONE)<br></li><li> difficulty levels (DONE)<br></li><li> more classes (WIP)<br></li><li> special blocks<br></li><li> special zombies<br></li><li> target prioritisation for your squad members<br></li><li> different game mode(s)<br></li><li> ... and more!</li></ul>",
